&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Travel&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;15%&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Firmware&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Metrea, our single core value is Rooted in Humility, and our four cornerstone attributes are Entrepreneurial, Systematic, Discerning, and Over-Deliver. These form what we call our Teammate Firmware. Just like technical firmware connects software and hardware, our Firmware is the constant interface between our mission and our people. It defines how we show up, how we work together, and how we solve complex problems.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our team Firmware creates a web-like, hyper-collaborative, dynamically hierarchical way of working that helps us adapt quickly, communicate openly, and distribute decision-making to where expertise actually lives. It enables groups to self-organize around hard problems, shift fluidly as priorities evolve, and operate with the trust, curiosity, and discipline required in a complex mission space. This foundation allows us to deliver elegant, effective solutions and uphold our purpose: protecting our precious inheritance.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk">Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h3&gt;Who we are&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Typeform is a refreshingly different form builder. We help over 150,000 businesses collect the data they need with forms, surveys, and quizzes that people enjoy. Designed to look striking and feel effortless to fill out, Typeform drives 500 million responses every year—and integrates with essential tools like Slack, Zapier, and Hubspot.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h3 data-pm-slice=&quot;1 3 []&quot;&gt;About the role&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Typeform, we believe technology should make work simpler, smarter and more human.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re looking for a&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Senior IT Engineer&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;to help shape the future of IT at Typeform. Someone who combines strong technical expertise with a passion for automation, AI and building better ways of working.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This isn&#39;t just about keeping systems running. It&#39;s about rethinking how IT operates.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You&#39;ll play a key role in building an AI first, service led IT function, improving how we manage internal technology, support our people and automate everyday processes.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Working within a small, high impact team, you&#39;ll have the opportunity to take ownership of meaningful projects, influence our technology roadmap and help us move from reactive support towards smarter, more proactive IT operations.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;What you&#39;ll do&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Own and improve our IT operations&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as a senior escalation point for complex IT incidents, requests and technical challenges, taking ownership through to resolution.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help maintain secure, reliable and scalable internal technology systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Apply ITIL best practices across incident, change, problem and service management.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Improve service performance, documentation, operational processes and the overall employee experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work closely with the wider IT team to balance daily support with longer term engineering projects.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Build smarter systems through AI and automation&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify opportunities to automate repetitive tasks and improve workflows across IT.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design and implement AI powered solutions that improve service delivery, productivity and operational efficiency.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Improve employee onboarding, offboarding, access management and software lifecycle processes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Use APIs, integrations, scripting and automation tools to connect systems and remove unnecessary manual work.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Explore emerging AI technologies and turn promising ideas into practical solutions, with appropriate security and governance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Think like a product owner&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Take ownership of specific IT services and capabilities, from identifying problems through to delivering improvements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work with stakeholders to understand their needs and prioritise improvements based on business impact.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and maintain clear roadmaps and project backlogs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Measure the success of improvements through service quality, efficiency, reliability and employee experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead technical changes, migrations and improvements with clear communication, risk management and planning.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Collaborate across Typeform&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with Security, People, Finance, Procurement and Engineering to deliver secure and effective technology solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Communicate technical concepts clearly to both technical and nontechnical colleagues.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Share knowledge, improve documentation and support the development of other IT team members.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help create a culture of ownership, continuous improvement and experimentation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;What you&#39;ll bring&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong experience in corporate IT engineering, systems engineering or IT service management within a modern SaaS or technology company.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;ITIL certification and practical experience&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;applying ITIL principles across incident, change, problem and service management.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven experience troubleshooting complex issues across corporate IT systems, identity, access, devices, applications and integrations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong hands on experience with modern IT environments, particularly Apple devices, Okta, Google Workspace, Slack and Atlassian.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience building automation using APIs, scripting, integrations or workflow automation tools.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Practical experience using AI to improve IT operations, support processes or internal productivity.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience improving employee lifecycle processes, including onboarding, offboarding, provisioning and access management.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong problem solving skills and the ability to take ownership of technical challenges from investigation through to resolution.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A product mindset, with experience prioritising improvements, managing stakeholders and delivering measurable outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent communication skills and the ability to work effectively across technical and business teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Nice to have&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience designing AI driven IT workflows or introducing AI into internal service operations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with AI agents, intelligent workflow orchestration and knowledge management systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience integrating HR, identity, finance, asset management and IT service platforms.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience building internal tooling, dashboards or operational reporting.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exposure to security, compliance, endpoint management and IT governance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience leading technology migrations or large internal systems improvement projects.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;*Typeform drives hundreds of millions of interactions each year, enabling conversational, human-centered experiences across the globe. We &lt;strong&gt;move as one team&lt;/strong&gt;, empowering our collective efforts by valuing each individual’s unique perspective. This fosters &lt;strong&gt;strong bonds&lt;/strong&gt; grounded in respect, transparency, and trust. We &lt;strong&gt;champion our diverse customer base&lt;/strong&gt; by anticipating their needs and addressing their challenges with priority. Committed to excellence, we&lt;strong&gt; hold high expectations &lt;/strong&gt;for ourselves and each other, continuously striving to deliver exceptional results.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are proud to be an equal-opportunity employer. We celebrate diversity and stand firmly against discrimination and harassment of any kind—whether based on race, color, ancestry, religion, sex, national origin, sexual orientation, age, citizenship, marital status, disability, gender identity or expression, or veteran status. Everyone is welcome here.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.nl">Jobs in Netherlands</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WPP is the trusted growth partner for the world’s leading brands.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We unite cutting-edge media intelligence and data solutions, world-class creativity, next-generation production, transformative enterprise solutions and expert strategic counsel in a single company – powered by exceptional talent and our agentic marketing platform, WPP Open, to help our clients navigate change, capture opportunity and deliver transformational growth.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We work with the world&#39;s most valuable brands and have global reach across 100+ markets, with deep local expertise.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our people are the key to our success. We&#39;re committed to fostering a culture of creativity, belonging and continuous learning, attracting and developing the brightest talent, and providing exciting career opportunities that help our people grow.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;For more information, visit &lt;a href=&quot;https://eur02.safelinks.protection.outlook.com/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fwpp.com%2F&amp;amp;data=05%7C02%7CErica.Durr%40wpp.com%7C9bf4566a65bc46a48ac008de749116ea%7C150b5e663d884dee83f6ed149b727a00%7C0%7C0%7C639076363668176216%7CUnknown%7CTWFpbGZsb3d8eyJFbXB0eU1hcGkiOnRydWUsIlYiOiIwLjAuMDAwMCIsIlAiOiJXaW4zMiIsIkFOIjoiTWFpbCIsIldUIjoyfQ%3D%3D%7C0%7C%7C%7C&amp;amp;sdata=Q9juosud56XGLThSFZ1NpPZd6FXpJPxV74OeRZWoh%2B4%3D&amp;amp;reserved=0&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;WPP.com.&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why we&#39;re hiring:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re looking for an Engineering Lead to help shape and deliver the future of Atlas, one of WPP&#39;s core enterprise platforms. This is a hands-on leadership role where you&#39;ll combine deep technical expertise with people leadership, guiding a team of engineers to build scalable, secure and high-performing integration solutions across our technology ecosystem.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You&#39;ll be the technical lead for the Azure based integration platform and services, driving engineering excellence, supporting the growth of your team, and helping to evolve the way we build and deliver software. Working closely with Product, Architecture and Engineering leaders, you&#39;ll play a key role in turning business needs into highly resilient, enterprise-grade solutions used across WPP.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you&#39;ll be doing:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead the design and delivery of Azure-based applications and integrations, ensuring solutions are scalable, secure and aligned with architectural standards.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as the technical lead for Azure API Management and integration services across the Atlas platform.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Champion engineering best practice, including SDLC, CI/CD, code quality, testing, automation, agentic/AI-assisted coding and continuous improvement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mentor, coach and develop engineers, fostering a high-performing and collaborative team culture.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner closely with Product, Architecture and delivery teams to translate requirements into robust technical solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive technical decision-making, manage risks and ensure successful delivery across multiple initiatives&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Delivering on multiple high-profile, concurrent integration projects serving large scale internal and client initiatives&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you&#39;ll need:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Essential experience&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong experience designing and delivering solutions on Microsoft Azure.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Expertise across Azure serverless and integration technologies, including API Management, Logic Apps, Function Apps and Event Grid.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience developing with Python and/or Node.js.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with containerisation technologies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with modern front-end frameworks such as Vue.js or React.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working with relational and NoSQL databases, including MongoDB.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong understanding of microservices architecture and Domain-Driven Design.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with Git-based development practices and workflows.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven experience implementing CI/CD pipelines using GitHub Actions and YAML&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Nice to have&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working with AI services and cloud-native AI technologies in Azure or AWS.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Practical application of SOLID principles and Test-Driven Development (TDD).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who you are:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You&#39;re open&lt;em&gt;:&lt;/em&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;we are inclusive and collaborative; we encourage the free exchange of ideas; we respect and celebrate diverse views. We are open-minded: to new ideas, new partnerships, new ways of working.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You&#39;re optimistic&lt;em&gt;:&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt; we approach all that we do with confidence: to try the new and to seek the unexpected.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You&#39;re extraordinary:&lt;/strong&gt; We are stronger together: through collaboration we achieve the amazing. We are creative leaders and pioneers of our industry; we provide extraordinary every day.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we&#39;ll give you:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Passionate, inspired people&lt;/strong&gt; – we champion a culture of people that do extraordinary work&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Scale and opportunity&lt;/strong&gt; – we offer the opportunity to create, influence and deliver projects at a scale that is unparalleled in the industry.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Challenging and stimulating work&lt;/strong&gt; – unique work and the opportunity to join a group of creative problem solvers.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(236, 240, 241);&quot;&gt;#LI-Hybrid&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We believe the best work happens when we&#39;re together, fostering creativity, collaboration, and connection. That&#39;s why we’ve adopted a hybrid approach, with teams in the office around four days a week. If you require accommodations or flexibility, please discuss this with the hiring team during the interview process.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WPP is an equal opportunity employer and considers applicants for all positions without discrimination or regard to particular characteristics. We are committed to fostering a culture of respect in which everyone feels they belong and has the same opportunities to progress in their careers.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Please read our Privacy Notice (&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.wpp.com/en/careers/wpp-privacy-policy-for-recruitment&quot;&gt;https://www.wpp.com/en/careers/wpp-privacy-policy-for-recruitment&lt;/a&gt;) for more information on how we process the information you provide.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;🚀 We’re on a mission to make money work for everyone.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re waving goodbye to the complicated and confusing ways of traditional banking.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;After starting as a prepaid card, our product offering has grown a lot in the last 10 years in the UK. As well as&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://monzo.com/current-account/personal&quot;&gt;personal&lt;/a&gt; and &lt;a href=&quot;https://monzo.com/business-banking&quot;&gt;business&lt;/a&gt; bank accounts, we offer &lt;a href=&quot;https://monzo.com/current-account/joint-account&quot;&gt;joint accounts&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://monzo.com/current-account/16-17&quot;&gt;accounts for 16-17 year olds&lt;/a&gt;, a &lt;a href=&quot;https://monzo.com/current-account/under-16s&quot;&gt;free kids account&lt;/a&gt; and &lt;a href=&quot;https://monzo.com/flex&quot;&gt;credit cards&lt;/a&gt; in the UK, with more exciting things to come beyond. Our UK customers can also &lt;a href=&quot;https://monzo.com/savings&quot;&gt;save&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://monzo.com/investments&quot;&gt;invest &lt;/a&gt;and&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://monzo.com/pensions&quot;&gt;combine their pensions&lt;/a&gt; with us.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;With our hot coral cards and get-paid-early feature, combined with financial education on social media and our award winning customer service, we have a long history of creating magical moments for our customers!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re not about selling products - we want to solve problems and change lives through Monzo ❤️&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;📍London/Cardiff/UK Remote | 💰£108,700 - £140,000 + equity + Incentive Awards tied to your performance + &lt;a href=&quot;https://monzo.com/careers/&quot;&gt;Benefits&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp; ✨&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Financial Crime &amp;amp; Fraud Collective&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt; ⭐&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re all about building trust and keeping our community safe while helping Monzo grow. The Financial Crime &amp;amp; Fraud Collective is at the heart of this work. As a Senior Fraud Risk Manager, you’ll lead the charge in keeping fraudsters at bay so our customers can bank with total confidence!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’ll get to work across current accounts, business banking, international accounts, and more. While you’ll be managing people and programs, you should also be excited to roll up your sleeves and get hands-on.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We need a crack team of crime fighters to help us stay one step ahead as we continue to grow.&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;🔑 You’ll play a key role by...&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Helping to lead our fast-growing global Fraud &amp;amp; Disputes Risk team and work alongside leaders across our cross-functional Fraud Squads. We’re looking for a proactive, collaborative leader who really knows fraud risk management inside and out - spanning several of our authorised fraud, unauthorised fraud, first-party fraud, and disputes specialisms&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’ll build great relationships with our Product, Engineering, Data, and Operations teams to design smooth, effective fraud controls, investigation processes, and reporting. You’ll also champion a positive team culture and make sure key fraud initiatives stay on track.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Your Core Focus Areas include&lt;strong&gt;:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Fraud Strategy &amp;amp; Operational Execution:&lt;/strong&gt; Join squad leadership to turn our big-picture fraud vision into practical roadmaps for our UK and EU Banks. You’ll strike the perfect balance between smart protection controls and a seamless customer experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Control Framework &amp;amp; Fraud SME:&lt;/strong&gt; Be our go-to expert on fraud typologies and prevention tools, overseeing end-to-end design and rollout of strong controls.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Threat Intelligence &amp;amp; Performance Analytics:&lt;/strong&gt; Embed data and threat monitoring to catch new fraud trends early, turning insights into quick control improvements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cross-Functional Coordination:&lt;/strong&gt; Partner closely with Product, Engineering, and Ops to keep initiatives aligned and moving forward.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;People Leadership &amp;amp; Capability Building&lt;/strong&gt;: Coach, mentor, and grow a fantastic fraud risk team while supporting everyone’s personal and professional development.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;🤩 We’d love to hear from you if…&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have strong experience leading fraud strategy and risk teams, ideally in a fast-moving, regulated environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You know UK &amp;amp; EU fraud regulations inside out.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You’re skilled at building tech-driven fraud strategies that scale across operations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have a proven track record of delivering end-to-end projects and large-scale change programs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You stay plugged into industry trends and can quickly respond to new fraud risks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You excel at balancing fraud risk with business goals and collaborating to ship new products safely.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You’re a supportive coach who loves developing high-performing teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You’re an empathetic communicator who aligns messaging with our core values.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You’re data-driven, comfortable self-serving data, and love using tech to solve problems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You hold a relevant industry qualification (such as ICA, Cifas, ACAMS, or CFE).&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;🙌 What’s in it for you&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;💰 £108,700 - £140,000 ➕Incentive Awards tied to your performance.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;📍This role can be based in our London office, but we&#39;re open to distributed working within the UK (with ad hoc meetings in London)&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;⏰ We offer flexible working hours and trust you to work enough hours to do your job well, and at times that suit you and your team.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;📚 £1,000 learning budget each year to use on books, training courses and conferences.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🏡 We will set you up to work from home; all employees are given Macbooks and for fully remote workers we will provide extra support for your work-from-home setup.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;➕ Plus lots more! &lt;a href=&quot;https://monzo.com/careers/&quot;&gt;Read our full list of benefits&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;🌈&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt; The application journey has 3 key steps&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;30 min call with the recruiter&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;30 min hiring manager call&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;2 hours of technical and leadership principle interviews&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;This process should take around 4-5 weeks - your schedule is really important to us, so we promise to be as flexible as possible!&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We have some guidelines on using Artificial Intelligence (AI) to ace an application and interview at Monzo. &lt;a href=&quot;https://monzo.com/blog/the-ultimate-guide-on-using-ai-to-ace-an-interview-at-monzo&quot;&gt;You can read them here.&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’ll only close this role once we have enough applications for the next stage. Please submit your application as soon as possible to make sure you don’t miss out.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;#LI-OS1 #LI-REMOTE&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Equal opportunities for everyone&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Diversity and inclusion are a priority for us and we’re making sure we have lots of support for all of our people to grow at Monzo. At Monzo, we’re embracing diversity by fostering an inclusive environment for all people to do the best work of their lives with us. This is integral to our mission of making money work for everyone. You can read more in our &lt;a href=&quot;https://monzo.com/blog/diversity-and-inclusion&quot;&gt;blog&lt;/a&gt;, 2026 &lt;a href=&quot;https://monzo.com/blog/our-2026-diversity-and-inclusion-report&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Diversity and Inclusion Report&lt;/a&gt; and 2025 &lt;a href=&quot;https://monzo.com/blog/gender-pay-gap-report-2025&quot;&gt;Gender Pay Gap Report.&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re an equal opportunity employer. All applicants will be considered for employment without attention to age, ethnicity, religion, sex, sexual orientation, gender identity, family or parental status, national origin, or veteran, neurodiversity or disability status.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you have a preferred name, please use it to apply. We don&#39;t need full or birth names at application stage 😊&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;At Affirm, we exist for the moments that matter—giving people a clear, predictable way to pay over time, with no hidden fees, no surprises, and no tradeoffs on what matters most.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;At Affirm, we exist for the moments that matter—giving people a clear, predictable way to pay over time, with no hidden fees, no surprises, and no tradeoffs on what matters most.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Payments International Engineering team builds and operates the systems that enable bank and card payments across Affirm’s international markets. Based in Europe, with teammates across the UK, Spain and Poland, we give customers familiar, local ways to pay, while building shared capabilities that make expansion into each new country easier.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our work spans improving existing payment experiences and building the foundations for launches in new countries. We solve challenges across currencies and local customer needs, creating reusable solutions that support Affirm’s international ambitions. We work closely with product and engineering teams across Affirm, connecting the customer experience with the financial systems behind it.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We own our work from design through to production, combining the pace of international expansion with the reliability, security and operational readiness that payments demand. Testing, monitoring and supporting our systems are integral to how we build. As a growing team, we also shape the architecture, tools and engineering practices that support this growth.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Joining Payments International means helping build the foundations of a global payments platform, with a direct connection between the systems we create and the customers Affirm can serve.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will be responsible for owning and delivering quarterly goals for your team, leading engineers on your team through ambiguity to solve open-ended problems, and ensuring that everyone is supported throughout delivery.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will support your peers and stakeholders in the product development lifecycle by collaborating with product management, design &amp;amp; analytics by participating in ideation, articulating technical constraints, and partnering on decisions that properly consider risks and trade-offs.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will proactively identify project, process, technology or business issues, advocate for them, and lead in solving them.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will support the operations and availability of your team’s artifacts by creating and monitoring metrics, escalating when needed, and supporting “keep the lights on” &amp;amp; on-call efforts.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will foster a culture of quality and ownership on your team by setting or improving code review and design standards for your team, and advocating for them beyond your team through your writing and tech talks.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will help develop talent on your team by providing feedback and guidance, and leading by example.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we look for&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You have 4+ years of experience designing, developing and launching backend systems at scale using languages like Python or Kotlin.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You have a track record of developing highly available distributed systems using technologies like AWS, MySQL and Kubernetes.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You have experience defining a technical plan for the delivery of a significant feature or system component with an elegant, simple and extensible design. You write high quality code that is easily understood and used by others.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You are proficient at making significant changes in a large code base, and have developed a suite of tools and practices that enable you and your team to do so safely.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Your experience demonstrates that you take ownership of your growth, proactively seeking feedback from your team, your manager, and your stakeholders.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You have strong verbal and written communication skills that support effective collaboration with our global engineering team.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Base Pay Grade - N&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Equity Grade - 5&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;br&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Employees new to Affirm typically come in at the start of the pay range. Affirm focuses on providing a simple and transparent pay structure which is based on a variety of factors, including location, experience and job-related skills.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;br&gt;Base pay is part of a total compensation package that may include monthly stipends for health, wellness and tech spending, and benefits (including 100% subsidised medical coverage, dental and vision for you and your dependents). In addition, the employees may be eligible for equity rewards offered by Affirm Holdings, Inc. (parent company).&lt;br&gt;
&lt;p&gt;GBP base pay range per year: £120,000 - £168,000&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Location: Remote UK&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Please note that visa sponsorship is not available for this position.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;#LI-Remote&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Remote-first with flexibility built in&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;Affirm is proud to be a remote-first company. Most roles can be done from almost anywhere within the country of employment. Some positions may occasionally require in-person work at an Affirm office, and a few are office-based due to the nature of the work. All new hires will be invited to attend an in-person onboarding experience.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Benefits designed for you&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;Our benefits reflect our commitment to care, transparency, and flexibility. Here are a few highlights:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Health coverage at no cost: We cover 100% of premiums for employees and their dependents.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Spending stipends: Monthly stipends support your tech setup, and the ability to choose health and wellness options that are right for you.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Time off to recharge: Flexible time off and generous holiday calendars help you rest when you need to.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own a piece of what you build: Our employee stock purchase plan (ESPP) lets you buy Affirm stock at a discount.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re committed to providing an inclusive interview process, including accommodations for candidates with disabilities. If you need support, we’re happy to help.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;For positions based in San Francisco or Los Angeles: Affirm considers qualified applicants with arrest and conviction records, as required by law.&lt;/p&gt;
